    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Camelplug Video Player adds a lightweight HTML5 video block to Gutenberg.</p>\n<p>Features:<br />\n&#8211; Select video from Media Library or paste direct video URL<br />\n&#8211; Toggle controls, autoplay, muted, loop, and plays inline<br />\n&#8211; Set preload behavior<br />\n&#8211; Set width, height, border radius, and object fit<br />\n&#8211; Responsive frontend output</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Open the block editor and add &#8220;Camelplug Video Player&#8221; block.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<h4>\nDoes it work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it works with standard WordPress themes.</p>\n</p>\n<h4>\nCan I use external video URLs?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can paste a direct video URL.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A simple and customizable HTML5 video player block for the WordPress block editor .",
    "description": "<p>Camelplug Video Player adds a lightweight HTML5 video block to Gutenberg.</p>\n<p>Features:<br />\n&#8211; Select video from Media Library or paste direct video URL<br />\n&#8211; Toggle controls, autoplay, muted, loop, and plays inline<br />\n&#8211; Set preload behavior<br />\n&#8211; Set width, height, border radius, and object fit<br />\n&#8211; Responsive frontend output</p>\n",
